+     * pool and Oilpan heap, and all the processes here share ONE address space (see the steamwebhelper note above), so a second one cannot get a pool.
+     * Same remedy as steamwebhelper's: run the browser in Chromium's single-process mode and refuse the --type= children. Only with
+     * MADEIRA_ROCKSTAR_SINGLE_PROCESS=1 (set by the app for Red Dead Redemption 2); the command lines are logged either way. */
